				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$171.77\pm 0.37\,\text {Ge}\hspace{-.08em}\text {V} $$\end{document}171.77±0.37GeV. This approach significantly improves the precision over previous measurements.

